## ============================================================================
# NOTE (2026-06-08): ConstellationNetworkView.vue + usePrebuiltNetwork(.Integration).ts
# + useLegoNetwork.ts were ALL DELETED. The network is no longer populated at
# runtime (ensureNetworkInitialized is a no-op). The section below documents the
